# ResideWell Pilot Proposal Builder

## Structure (in order)

1. Headline
2. The opportunity (property-specific)
3. The problem
4. The recommended pilot
5. What is included
6. What ResideWell handles
7. What the property team handles
8. Timeline
9. Success metrics
10. Investment
11. Next step

## Default pilot

8 weeks · 1 live class per week · launch marketing · resident registration QR code · attendance tracking · resident feedback survey · final engagement report · annual program recommendation

## Default price

**$4,000** (lean $3,500 / premium $5,000 — mention only on the call)

## Tone

Premium, concise, operationally clear, property-manager friendly. Do not make it look like a personal training flyer — make it look like a resident experience solution.

Template: `proposal/8-week-pilot-one-pager.md`. Export: `proposal/export-instructions.md`. Send within 24 hours of the discovery call.
